OL,3,AWettest week for two years but still
OL,4,Anot enough rain to get out of drought
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe recent stormy weather brought
OL,7,FEngland's wettest week in two years,
OL,8,Faccording to the Environment Agency.
OL,10,FHowever, despite the rain, Wales and
OL,11,Fmost of England are still in drought
OL,12,Fwith parts of southern England in
OL,13,Fsevere drought.
OL,15,FMet Office provisional statistics for
OL,16,FOctober show that the UK received above
OL,17,Faverage rainfall.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,310,300,200,140,0,100
