OL,3,AWettest week for two years but still
OL,4,Anot enough rain to get out of drought
OL,5,
OL,6,FHowever, the National Drought Group
OL,7,Fhave said it will take sustained and
OL,8,Fabove average rainfall over a seven
OL,9,Fmonth period for conditions to improve
OL,10,Fto normal.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
